      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty big difference in how you're characterizing them. Why do you say Nigeria has those specific risks with quality and deliveries compared to Vietnam? Is it just a matter of infrastructure, or is there something about the local way of doing business there that makes it harder to trust?",
